Before going to the office, I make a video call to Mexico.
My whole family is on the screen.
Mom, Dad, Diego, and Sofia are looking at me.
They all sing 'Happy Birthday' loudly together.
Behind them, our dog Lola is also barking continuously.
I laugh and say, "Quiet, Lola!"
"And thank you everyone."
Mom asks, "Maya, has the birthday parcel we sent arrived there?"
I say, "Yes Mom, that parcel arrived yesterday."
Dad asks, "What have you planned for this evening?"
I tell them, "I will celebrate my birthday with friends after the office."
This is my very first birthday away from home.
Diego and Sofia say, "We are missing you a lot today."
I tell them, "I am missing you a lot too."
But seeing their smiling faces, I have become very happy.
I take everyone's leave and put the phone down.
Now I am ready to step out into the Mumbai rain.
